[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1691956793","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2057#issuecomment-1691956793","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2057","id":1691956793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85k2TY5","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-08-24T15:51:24Z","updated_at":"2023-08-24T15:51:24Z","body":"I do note that it has the word \"REGENTS\" hanging out in the disclaimer paragraph. Not a problem for matching purposes since it's within the alt-text for \"THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER OR CONTRIBUTORS,\" but just amusing to still see little straggler bits of the original BSD license hanging on  :)\r\n\r\nI would _not_ want to accommodate this into standard BSD-2-Clause via markup. That's for several reasons, in particular because I don't believe their characterization of the license text actually reflects what (I think) it says. Which is fine, but I think it's over the line of \"is this substantively different\" to mean that markup isn't warranted.\r\n\r\nI don't know if we have an official policy on \"is this blurb of language part of the official license text or not\" when it shows up immediately following the license text. I don't know how we could draft that in a way that would be machine parseable. \r\n\r\nGiven that, I'm inclined to say that this should be a separate license identifier (if we determine that it otherwise meets the requirements to be on the list).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1691956793/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1710819395","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2057#issuecomment-1710819395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2057","id":1710819395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85l-QhD","user":{"login":"Pizza-Ria","id":46799628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Nzk5NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46799628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizza-Ria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-07T22:00:12Z","updated_at":"2